data: {"id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6-thinking-parallel_evidence-790", "run_id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实：\n1. Pod 当前状态仍为 CrashLoopBackOff，RESTARTS=11，表明异常持续存在。\n2. kubectl_describe 显示容器最近一次退出的 Exit Code 为 137（OOM Killed），且 kubelet 报告 Liveness probe 失败（HTTP 500）。\n3. kubectl_events 显示 Liveness probe 失败和 BackOff 重启事件在 25 分钟内多次触发，符合 CrashLoopBackOff 的典型行为。\n\n冲突点：\n- Liveness probe 返回 500 表明应用可能已启动但逻辑异常或无响应。\n- 但同时存在 Exit Code 137，表明应用进程也可能被系统因内存超限（OOM）而强制杀掉。这暗示异常的直接原因可能是内存不足导致进程崩溃，而 Liveness probe 的 500 可能是进程崩溃前的短暂响应。\n\n缺口：\n- 需要查看容器退出前的具体日志，以确认是 OOM 触发还是应用逻辑错误导致。\n- 需要确认该 Pod 是否配置了内存限制（Limits），以验证 OOM 假", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789354436516, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6", "seq": 791, "ts_ms": 1789354446920, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 56.663, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-10", "name": "workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/ba9af7ff00af42a6-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "c32072cb7e42f86a554adf3bf28d0f56cb1db91cede563674f77f49c6d81d4f0", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "27783a2eac912bfda8fcafb432f9898c38fcdd7e953102d3ce5adac087884fc5"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6", "seq": 792, "ts_ms": 1789354446921, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6", "seq": 793, "ts_ms": 1789354456805, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.884, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1658, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，持续重启且无法就绪。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning Unhealthy: Liveness probe failed with statuscode: 500 (fact-a4ac8b423062) | 记录应用存活探针持续失败的直接现象，导致 Pod 重启机制触发 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning BackOff: Back-off restarting failed container (fact-ab03649ac149) | 证明容器处于频繁重启状态，最终表现为 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container last terminated reason: Error; Exit Code: 137 (fact-b4d94f5490d3, fact-e6008d7ee486) | 退出码 137 是进程被 OOM Killer 强制终止的特征，指向内存不足 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource limit (memory): 96Mi (fact-670da840bf5b) | 提供了导致 OOM 的环境上下文，限制值相对严格 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason (CrashLoopBackOff): 1; restarts_total: 11 (fact-60ba221d9652, fact-6144ee5dd9e9) | 独立于 Kubernetes API，从 Metrics 维度证实了重启次数和状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 的 Event 明确记录了探针失败和重启行为，而 `Exit Code: 137` 结合 96Mi 的内存限制，共同指向了资源耗尽导致进程被杀的根本原因。Metrics 数据（Restart Count 11, CrashLoopBackOff 状态）与 K8s 状态完全印证，排除了偶发性故障。Logging 和 Tracing 展示的是应用正常响应时的快照，与当前崩溃状态处于不同时间线。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制（96Mi）过低 → 内存不足触发 OOM Killer → 进程被强制终止（Exit Code 137） → Liveness 探针失败触发重启 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：容器内存配置过低导致 OOM（Out of Memory）。\n证据 `[fact-b4d94f5490d3, fact-e6008d7ee486]` 中的 `Exit Code: 137` 是 Linux 内核 OOM Killer 终止进程的明确标志，这直接证实了应用因内存不足被强制杀死的推断。结合证据 `[fact-670da840bf5b]` 中 96Mi 的硬限制，说明该限制不足以支撑应用稳定运行。该进程终止导致了探针失败和后续的重启风暴。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，持续重启且无法就绪。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning Unhealthy: Liveness probe failed with statuscode: 500 (fact-a4ac8b423062) | 记录应用存活探针持续失败的直接现象，导致 Pod 重启机制触发 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning BackOff: Back-off restarting failed container (fact-ab03649ac149) | 证明容器处于频繁重启状态，最终表现为 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container last terminated reason: Error; Exit Code: 137 (fact-b4d94f5490d3, fact-e6008d7ee486) | 退出码 137 是进程被 OOM Killer 强制终止的特征，指向内存不足 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource limit (memory): 96Mi (fact-670da840bf5b) | 提供了导致 OOM 的环境上下文，限制值相对严格 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason (CrashLoopBackOff): 1; restarts_total: 11 (fact-60ba221d9652, fact-6144ee5dd9e9) | 独立于 Kubernetes API，从 Metrics 维度证实了重启次数和状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 的 Event 明确记录了探针失败和重启行为，而 `Exit Code: 137` 结合 96Mi 的内存限制，共同指向了资源耗尽导致进程被杀的根本原因。Metrics 数据（Restart Count 11, CrashLoopBackOff 状态）与 K8s 状态完全印证，排除了偶发性故障。Logging 和 Tracing 展示的是应用正常响应时的快照，与当前崩溃状态处于不同时间线。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制（96Mi）过低 → 内存不足触发 OOM Killer → 进程被强制终止（Exit Code 137） → Liveness 探针失败触发重启 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：容器内存配置过低导致 OOM（Out of Memory）。\n证据 `[fact-b4d94f5490d3, fact-e6008d7ee486]` 中的 `Exit Code: 137` 是 Linux 内核 OOM Killer 终止进程的明确标志，这直接证实了应用因内存不足被强制杀死的推断。结合证据 `[fact-670da840bf5b]` 中 96Mi 的硬限制，说明该限制不足以支撑应用稳定运行。该进程终止导致了探针失败和后续的重启风暴。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6-final", "run_id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6", "seq": 795, "ts_ms": 1789354456821, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，持续重启且无法就绪。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning Unhealthy: Liveness probe failed with statuscode: 500 (fact-a4ac8b423062) | 记录应用存活探针持续失败的直接现象，导致 Pod 重启机制触发 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | Warning BackOff: Back-off restarting failed container (fact-ab03649ac149) | 证明容器处于频繁重启状态，最终表现为 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Container last terminated reason: Error; Exit Code: 137 (fact-b4d94f5490d3, fact-e6008d7ee486) | 退出码 137 是进程被 OOM Killer 强制终止的特征，指向内存不足 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Container resource limit (memory): 96Mi (fact-670da840bf5b) | 提供了导致 OOM 的环境上下文，限制值相对严格 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason (CrashLoopBackOff): 1; restarts_total: 11 (fact-60ba221d9652, fact-6144ee5dd9e9) | 独立于 Kubernetes API，从 Metrics 维度证实了重启次数和状态 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 的 Event 明确记录了探针失败和重启行为，而 `Exit Code: 137` 结合 96Mi 的内存限制，共同指向了资源耗尽导致进程被杀的根本原因。Metrics 数据（Restart Count 11, CrashLoopBackOff 状态）与 K8s 状态完全印证，排除了偶发性故障。Logging 和 Tracing 展示的是应用正常响应时的快照，与当前崩溃状态处于不同时间线。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制（96Mi）过低 → 内存不足触发 OOM Killer → 进程被强制终止（Exit Code 137） → Liveness 探针失败触发重启 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：容器内存配置过低导致 OOM（Out of Memory）。\n证据 `[fact-b4d94f5490d3, fact-e6008d7ee486]` 中的 `Exit Code: 137` 是 Linux 内核 OOM Killer 终止进程的明确标志，这直接证实了应用因内存不足被强制杀死的推断。结合证据 `[fact-670da840bf5b]` 中 96Mi 的硬限制，说明该限制不足以支撑应用稳定运行。该进程终止导致了探针失败和后续的重启风暴。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 56.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r: 56.7s (Evidence 46.4s, RCA 10.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.047, "metrics": {"run_id": "ba9af7ff00af42a6", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.04670286178589, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "58%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 100%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 87046.70286178589, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 68973.12951087952, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 41888.15093040466, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 17673.21252822876}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20478.67512702942, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 56663.0756855011, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9883.894205093384, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

